CodePane-EYx4bd" dir=3D"ltr"><code class=3D"whitespace-pre! block text-size=
-code CodeContent-ybJ8Tl min-w-max"><span>Algorithm: DART-ALGO

INPUT:
    Student profile U
    Academic subject D
    Knowledge graph G
    Learning objectives O
    Educational resources E

INITIALIZATION:
    Load shared neural model
    Load subject-specific model
    Initialize student knowledge state
    Initialize RL policy

FOR each learning interaction t:

    1. COLLECT STUDENT DATA
       Observe question, response, time and hint usage

    2. UPDATE KNOWLEDGE REPRESENTATION
       Encode the current concept
       Identify prerequisite relationships

    3. ESTIMATE STUDENT STATE
       Apply graph encoder
       Apply temporal Transformer
       Estimate mastery and retention
       Estimate predictive uncertainty

    4. CONSTRUCT RL STATE
       Combine student state
       Add course context
       Add academic level
       Add available resources

    5. SELECT INSTRUCTIONAL STRATEGY
       Select teaching strategy
       Select teaching method
       Select instructional parameters

    6. APPLY EDUCATIONAL SAFETY CHECK
       Verify prerequisites
       Verify difficulty constraints
       Verify curriculum requirements

    7. DELIVER INSTRUCTION
       Provide learning material or assessment

    8. OBSERVE STUDENT RESPONSE
       Record new interaction

    9. UPDATE LEARNING MODEL
       Update knowledge state
       Evaluate learning improvement
       Update retention estimates

   10. UPDATE RL POLICY
       Record transition
       Calculate reward
       Update policy during approved training

END FOR

OUTPUT:
    Student learning profile
    Adaptive learning path
